Sughra Ne Khat Me Likha Tanha Na Jee Sakungi<br>
Aajou Mere Baba Tanha Na Jee Sakungi<br>
<br>
1.Badhti Hi jaarahi hai Shiddath Mere Maraz Ki<br>
Bechain Hu Main Baba tanha Na Jee Sakungi<br>
<br>
2.Mehmaan Hu Kuch Hi Dum Ki Aajou Ab Palat Kar<br>
Yeh Dil Hai Para Para Tanha Na Jee Sakungi<br>
<br>
3.Nazdeek Aagayi Hu Main Mout Ke Bhot Ab<br>
Marjaungi Main Baba Tanha Na Jee Sakungi<br>
<br>
4.Tham Jaiengi Yeh Saansein Ro Ro Ke Kuch Hi Dum Me<br>
Sach Kehrahi Hu Baba Tanha Na Jee Sakungi<br>
<br>
5.Jabse Gaye Hu Baba Ro Ro Ke Sune Ghar Me<br>
Dum Ghut Raha Hai Mera Tanha Na Jee Sakungi<br>
<br>
6.Le Jao Aakey Akber Is Gham Zada Behan Ku<br>
Tumse Bichadh Ke Bhaiya Tanha Na Jee Sakungi<br>
<br>
7.Har Waqt Mere Dil Ku Kunbe Se Chootne Ka<br>
Tadhpa Raha Hai Sadma Tanha Na Jee Sakungi<br>
<br>
8.Karti Na Koi Shikwa Asghar Jo Ghar Me Hota<br>
Kat Jaata Waqt Mere Tanha Na Jee Sakungi<br>
<br>
9.Meri Phuphi Se Maa Se Khehdijiye Chacha Se<br>
Aajou Ghar Khudara Tanha Na Jee Sakungi<br>
<br>
10.Aajou Tum Jo Baba Raunaq Palat Ke Aaye<br>
Veraan Hai Madina Tanha Na Jee Sakungi<br>
<br>
11.Ansou Thame Na Mazhar Ankhou Se Shah-e-Deen Ke<br>
Padhkar Kalam-e-Sughra Tanha Na Jee Sakungi
